        en: { homeLead: 'iOS apps designed for everyday needs, emergencies, mobility and public services in France.', deletion: 'The app does not create a user account. Local data can be removed by deleting the app or from settings when an option exists.', adDetails: 'The Google Mobile Ads and User Messaging Platform kits send directly to Google, without going through the developer: the device advertising identifier (only if you allow tracking), the IP address and an approximate location derived from it, the device model and system, performance and diagnostic data, and your interactions with ads. Google uses them to show, measure and cap ads, personalize them if you consent and fight fraud, under its own privacy policy (policies.google.com/privacy).', retention: 'Local data remains on your device until you delete the app or reset settings. Advertising data follows Google AdMob rules and purchases follow Apple rules when they exist.', feature: 'Feature', featuresTitle: 'Features', privacyLead: "No account, no profile, no data resale. This page states what the app processes, why, and what you can require of it." },
